### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Readiness Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create Solicitude (Valid)
POST http://localhost:8000/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "REQ-001",
  "request_type": "soporte técnico",
  "requester_name": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "description": "No puedo acceder al sistema de notas.",
  "priority": "alta"
}

###

### 4. Create Solicitude (Invalid Email - 422)
POST http://localhost:8000/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "REQ-002",
  "request_type": "soporte técnico",
  "requester_name": "Maria",
  "email": "correo-invalido",
  "description": "Falla la plataforma",
  "priority": "baja"
}

###

### 5. Get All Solicitudes (With filters)
GET http://localhost:8000/solicitudes?status=recibida&priority=alta
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get Specific Solicitude
GET http://localhost:8000/solicitudes/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Update Status
PATCH http://localhost:8000/solicitudes/1/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "en proceso"
}
